## Getting started

```bash
cp .env.example .env
{% if tooling.package_manager == "uv" %}
uv sync
{% else %}
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e ".[dev]"
{% endif %}
{% if uses_record %}
sillo-start migrate run
{% endif %}
{% if admin.enabled %}
sillo-start admin create-user
{% endif %}
sillo-start dev
```

`sillo-start dev` starts every service this project needs
{%- if inertia.enabled %} — the API, the Vite dev server{% if queue.enabled %}, the queue worker{% endif %}{% if scheduler.enabled %} and the scheduler{% endif %}{% endif %}.

| Service | URL |
| ------- | --- |
| Application | http://localhost:{{ app.port }} |
{% if api.openapi %}
| API docs | http://localhost:{{ app.port }}/docs |
{% endif %}
{% if inertia.enabled %}
| Frontend (dev) | http://localhost:{{ inertia.port }} |
{% endif %}
{% if admin.enabled %}
| Admin | http://localhost:{{ app.port }}{{ admin.prefix }} |
{% endif %}

## Layout

```text
{{ project.name }}/
├── app/
│   ├── bootstrap.py      # assembles the application
│   ├── config.py         # typed settings loaded from .env
│   └── main.py           # ASGI entrypoint
{% if uses_record %}
├── database/
│   ├── models/           # Record models
│   └── migrations/       # generated migrations
{% endif %}
├── routes/               # routers mounted onto the app
{% if inertia.enabled %}
├── {{ inertia.frontend_path }}/             # {{ inertia.adapter }} + Vite frontend
{% endif %}
├── storage/              # logs, cache, uploads
├── tests/
├── pyproject.toml
└── sillo.toml            # project manifest — read by sillo-start
```

## Common commands

```bash
sillo-start dev                       # run everything
sillo-start dev --only backend        # run one service
{% if uses_record %}
sillo-start migrate make -m "add posts"
sillo-start migrate run
sillo-start generate model Post
{% endif %}
sillo-start doctor                    # diagnose the project
sillo-start inspect                   # show configuration
{% if tooling.pytest %}
pytest                                # run the test suite
{% endif %}
```
